# proto-drift

A CLI tool to detect drift between protobuf/gRPC definitions and generated SDK stubs.

## Usage

```bash
proto-drift scan [--json] [--fail-on-drift]
proto-drift check --proto <path> --sdk <path>
proto-drift init   # creates .proto-drift.toml
```

## Exit Codes

- `0`: No drift detected
- `1`: Drift detected (or error)
